### =========================================================================
### Task Manager Application — API Automated Test Scenarios (REST Client)
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5002/api
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Register New User
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Alex Mercer",
  "email": "alex.mercer@taskmanager.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Register Duplicate User (Expect 400 Validation Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Alex Mercer",
  "email": "alex.mercer@taskmanager.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Login User
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "alex.mercer@taskmanager.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store Auth Token from Login
@authToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### 5. Get Current User Profile (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Get Profile Without Token (Expect 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### TASK MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Create Task 1 — High Priority Work Task
# @name createTask1
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Build MERN Task Manager API",
  "description": "Design REST endpoints, implement JWT auth, connect MongoDB, and test with REST Client.",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": "urgent",
  "category": "Work",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-10T18:00:00.000Z"
}

### Store Task 1 ID
@task1Id = {{createTask1.response.body.data.task._id}}

### 8. Create Task 2 — Study Task
# @name createTask2
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Study React Router v6 & Context API",
  "description": "Review protected route patterns and global state handling with createContext and useContext.",
  "status": "todo",
  "priority": "high",
  "category": "Study",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-15T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### 9. Create Task 3 — Personal Task (Completed)
# @name createTask3
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Weekly Grocery Shopping",
  "description": "Buy fresh fruits, vegetables, almond milk, and coffee beans.",
  "status": "completed",
  "priority": "medium",
  "category": "Personal",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-05T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### 10. Get All Tasks (No Filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Search Tasks by Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?search=MERN HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Filter Tasks by Status (todo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=todo HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Filter Tasks by Priority (urgent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?priority=urgent HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. Filter Tasks by Category (Work) & Sort by Due Date Ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?category=Work&sortBy=dueDate&order=asc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. Get Task Analytics / Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 16. Get Single Task By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{task1Id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 17. Update Task Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{task1Id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Build MERN Task Manager API (Updated)",
  "description": "Successfully designed REST endpoints and added full validation.",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": "high",
  "category": "Work"
}

### 18. Quick Toggle Status (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{task1Id}}/status HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 19. Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{task1Id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 20. Verify Deletion (Expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{task1Id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
